# Dev-only. Loaded by `vite` / `npm run dev`, NOT by `vite build`, so the
# production bundle is unaffected (Vercel sets its own VITE_API_URL).
#
# `/api` is relative, so the browser sends requests to the Vite dev server,
# which proxies them to the live backend (see `server.proxy` in vite.config.ts).
# Going through the dev-server proxy means the browser sees same-origin
# responses — no CORS, no local backend needed.
VITE_API_URL=/api
